[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328388818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3328388818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3328388818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GYy7S","user":{"login":"OS-of-S","id":171816144,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj200A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171816144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S","html_url":"https://github.com/OS-of-S","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T13:17:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T13:17:43Z","body":"Ok, I found not so ugly workaround for my case, but it works only if you don't want to use null value for some logic.\n\n```\n@export var distribution_curve: Curve = _linear_distribution_curve_constructor():\n\tset(_new_curve):\n\t\tif _new_curve == null: distribution_curve = _linear_distribution_curve_constructor()\n\t\telse: distribution_curve = _new_curve\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3328388818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3333318240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3333318240","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3333318240,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GrmZg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T10:30:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T10:30:59Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n- A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).\n- Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n- Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**\n- **Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3333318240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334440173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3334440173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3334440173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Gv4Tt","user":{"login":"OS-of-S","id":171816144,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj200A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171816144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S","html_url":"https://github.com/OS-of-S","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T14:26:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T15:05:41Z","body":"MRP:  [problem_with_resource.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22538999/problem_with_resource.zip)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/acf32a56-6c16-4c94-a2c4-0cac11629a7c","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334440173/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334907155","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3334907155","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3334907155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GxqUT","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-25T16:09:06Z","updated_at":"2025-09-25T16:09:06Z","body":"Override `_property_can_revert()` and `_property_get_revert()` functions seems can freeze the default value.\n\n```\n@tool\nextends Node\nclass_name SomeTestResource\n\n\n@export var distribution_curve: Curve = _linear_distribution_curve_constructor()\n\n@export var value_num: float = 8.0\n\nstatic func _linear_distribution_curve_constructor() -> Curve:\n\tvar curve: Curve\n\tcurve = Curve.new()\n\tcurve.add_point(Vector2(0.0, 0.0), 0, 0, Curve.TangentMode.TANGENT_LINEAR, Curve.TangentMode.TANGENT_LINEAR)\n\tcurve.add_point(Vector2(1.0, 1.0), 0, 0, Curve.TangentMode.TANGENT_LINEAR, Curve.TangentMode.TANGENT_LINEAR)\n\treturn curve\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tprint(property_can_revert(\"value_num\"))\n\tprint(property_get_revert(\"value_num\"))\n\nfunc _property_can_revert(propertyName: StringName) -> bool:\n\tif propertyName == \"distribution_curve\":\n\t\treturn true\n\tif propertyName == \"value_num\":\n\t\treturn true\n\treturn false\n\nfunc _property_get_revert(propertyName: StringName):\n\tif propertyName == \"distribution_curve\":\n\t\treturn _linear_distribution_curve_constructor()\n\tif propertyName == \"value_num\":\n\t\treturn 8.0\n\treturn null\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3334907155/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571078298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3571078298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3571078298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U2lSa","user":{"login":"SanNull","id":124409014,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2pUtg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull","html_url":"https://github.com/SanNull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SanNull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T14:29:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T14:29:52Z","body":"This doesn't happen only to Resources assigned to static functions, but also when you have something like this on a tool script:\n\n`@export var res: CircleShape2D = CircleShape2D.new() `\n \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571078298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720166327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3720166327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3720166327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dvTu3","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T18:24:08Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T18:24:44Z","body":"I tested this and examined the code recently, and I don't believe this issue is fixable. The Default Values found by the Inspector have to be resolvable to a constant result by the GDScript Expression Compiler, and a Static Function **is not the same** as a constant result. \n\nRelevant Code: [Editor_inspector.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5d9722e83288f33827bcad70561f0737f8cde456/editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp#L790) & [Property_utils.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/property_utils.cpp#L79)\n\nYou can see this yourself if you try to assign the same values to a GDScript Constant.\n\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"206\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14514eab-09ed-4356-b342-0a7a209583bf\" />\n\nThe desired behavior is exactly why GDScript provides overrides for _property_can_revert and _property_get_revert (As mentioned by @xuhuisheng )\n\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-private-method-property-can-revert\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720166327/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725683093","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110862#issuecomment-3725683093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110862","id":3725683093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eEWmV","user":{"login":"OS-of-S","id":171816144,"node_id":"U_kgDOCj200A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171816144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S","html_url":"https://github.com/OS-of-S","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OS-of-S/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T20:36:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T20:44:02Z","body":"Sooo... Maybe it could be easer to fix on an editer level, by rewriting the button logic? Basically, it should provide the same function that is made during initial asigning, instead of picking the value as const.\n\nBut yeah, I see. It would require access to the script's interpretation, and I'm not sure how hard or easy to obtain that. And also -- than we lost probability of tracking \"if value differs from the original right now\" -- the conditions on which the value is assigned may be changed.\n\nYeah, don't think we should keep the initial value itself either -- it may be non-intuitive for a most cases. Mayb... Maybe it would be better just to turn off this button for a function asigning :( Or... maybe we could left it for a static functions only? Or change the entire interface somehow...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3725683093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]